@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tasco-nouns`

-- Chương I, the general provisions about the contract itself: Điều 1 (the contract), Điều 2
-- (the period and the premium), Điều 3 (termination and refunds), Điều 6 (transfer of
-- ownership) and Điều 12 (agreed extensions).
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/tasco-combined-motor-2024.txt.
--
-- PERIODS. Every period in this module is in days ("ngày"), which the rules do not define.
-- Where they mean working days they say so (Điều 13.1.2(a), "ngày làm việc"), so a bare "ngày"
-- is read as a calendar day (fork F7). In a DEONTIC the number after WITHIN is that many days.

§ `Chương I — general provisions: the contract`

